# CRUD + Search — no duplicate where

## Required behavior

- Filters live once on the Table Search manager.
- CRUD index applies Search; listeners must not re-state the same `where` trees.
- Pagination must preserve filter query params per project PRG/Search patterns.

## Anti-patterns

- Twin `where` in Search filter and `Crud.beforePaginate`
- Controller `where` piles beside enabled Search
